---

# 🩺 Patient Prediction Features

Sugar Scan provides interactive clinical parameter inputs.

Supported biomarkers:

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| Pregnancies | Number of pregnancies |
| Glucose | Blood glucose concentration |
| Blood Pressure | Patient blood pressure |
| Skin Thickness | Skin fold thickness |
| Insulin | Insulin level |
| BMI | Body Mass Index |
| Diabetes Pedigree Function | Genetic diabetes risk factor |
| Age | Patient age |

---

# ⚡ Interactive User Interface

## Features:

### 🎚️ Smart Input Controls

Each medical parameter includes:

- Range sliders
- Numeric input boxes
- Increment/decrement buttons

---

### 🔴 Live Prediction Mode

Prediction updates instantly when values change.

Displays:

- Diabetes probability percentage
- Risk category
- Model prediction

---

